      "enumerationTrap": "/batch/v1 is registered as a route (class-wp-rest-server.php:115) but is ABSENT from the route index''s `namespaces[]` array, so a namespaces[]-only enumeration misses it entirely. It is modelled here as a batch CAPABILITY on the Integration row, not as an IntegrationObject."
    },
    "woocommerce": {
